{"labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn11le03ob04re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Hey Kristi, do you have a minute?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Sure, Ms. Moore. How can I help?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: I have to do a sales pitch to the local school board. We want to sell them a textbook on financial literacy. Would you like to hear my pitch?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Sure! I'd love to.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Hello, my name is Denise Moore and I work for Books for People Publishing. We are a leading provider of printed material for educational institutions in the Boston area. We have published a number of award-winning educational materials, including such widely known titles as <span class=\"italic\">The Government: Mine and Yours</span>, <span class=\"italic\">Fun Facts of Science</span>, and <span class=\"italic\">Amazing Shapes</span>.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: So far so good.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn11le03ob04re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Here at BFP Publishing, we have embarked on an exciting project publishing a series of workbooks designed to help teachers explore financial literacy in the classroom. Financial literacy is the ability to use knowledge and skills to make informed money management decisions. At the lower grade levels, it includes everyday skills such as writing checks and adding up sums of money, and goes on to more complicated notions such as understanding the stock market and planning for retirement. We feel that these topics are not adequately covered through the math and social studies units that are presently taught.", "id": 2, "time": "42000", "image": "engenn11le03ob04re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Very interesting.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: At BFP Publishing, we know that schools are busy places. Financial literacy is not likely to become a new subject on its own. That is why we have created a series of 12 workbooks that can be easily integrated into other subject areas. For example, at the lower grades, our workbooks are tied to picture and chapter books. At the upper grades, the workbooks can be used in history courses to help understand the Great Depression. In advanced mathematics courses, students learn about how banking works.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I'm sold!", "id": 3, "time": "81000", "image": "engenn11le03ob04re2img07.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le03ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le03ob04re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can present a sales pitch.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can express advice when selling a product.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can distinguish between different intonation patterns.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Do you think it is hard to sell things? Why? Why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Why are some people better at selling things than other people?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Pronunciation Spot: Here's the pitch!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "type": "WLC", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " Ms. Moore practices her <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">pitch</span>!", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Click on the play button to listen to the audio.", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": [{"content": "A <span class=\"italic\">\"pitch\"</span> is something you throw, like a baseball. In this meaning, a <span class=\"italic\">\"pitch\"</span> means to throw words or ideas.", "type": "text", "tip_id": 0}], "type": "tips"}], "type": "STI", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 2, "stimuli_ids": [], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "At BFP Publishing,// we know that schools are busy places. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selec